    "commit-agreement": "The append and last_hash advance are one audit-owner commit; every successful concrete append is classified as Record and no bypass writer exists.",
    "failure-persistence-agreement": "The canonical model has no failure action; any crash, storage loss, retry, or recovery step must map explicitly and preserve the evidence observation claimed.",
